            "text": "Make public work verifiable without taking the speaker on faith: hashed receipts, timed files, open software, and MASTER records. You don’t get to know me. You get to understand the work. | Receipt-first, local-first. Cite files and hashes over paraphrase. | Residual uncertainty stays. Do not flatten GodLock scores into certainty. | Freedom of information stays open via Allow, sitemap, llms, cite, shelves, MCP, and Glama. | Forks welcome. Apache-2.0 where released."
